---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LeadForm from '../../components/LeadForm.astro';
import { STICKY_ABU_DHABI } from '../../data/sticky-cta';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Abu Dhabi Property Investment: Free Shortlist"
  description="Abu Dhabi property shortlist for foreign investors. Saadiyat, Yas and Al Reem often price below Dubai equivalents. Golden Visa AED 2M. Licensed partner review."
  stickyCta={STICKY_ABU_DHABI}
>
  <section class="site-container py-12 md:py-16 max-w-3xl">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <span class="badge-pill mb-4">Abu Dhabi</span>
      <h1 class="mb-4">Abu Dhabi property investment</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-muted)]">
        Momentum market with designated freehold zones. We shortlist by yield (Al Reef) vs appreciation (Saadiyat) vs lifestyle (Yas).
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5">
        <a href="#lead-form" class="btn-primary">Get Abu Dhabi options</a>
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose mb-10">
      <p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Nine freehold investment zones under Law 13/2019. Gross yields run roughly 5 to 9% depending on district, and foreign buyers made up close to 88% of recent Aldar sales volume.</p>
      <p><a href="/guides/abu-dhabi-property-investment-guide/">Abu Dhabi investment guide</a> · <a href="/compare/abu-dhabi-vs-dubai-investment/">Abu Dhabi vs Dubai</a></p>
      <p>Compare markets: <a href="/gcc-rental-yields/">GCC rental yields hub</a> · <a href="/invest-abu-dhabi-off-plan/">Abu Dhabi off-plan</a></p>
    </div>
    <LeadForm title="Abu Dhabi property shortlist" subtitle="Yield · family · capital growth" context="Abu Dhabi property investment landing" />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
